# Issue

Use this skill to resolve or create the task context before planning.

## Protocol

1. Read `{{ manifesto_path }}` and `ai.config.yaml`.
2. If tracker is enabled, use `.ai/linear-scope.json` and `.ai/rules/linear-mcp.mdc`.
3. Ensure the issue/spec has enough detail for `/plan`.
4. If details are missing, route to `/clarify`.
